  "question": {
    "text": "If a piece of metal is heated to temperature<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math> and then allowed to cool in a room which is at temperature<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>, the graph between the temperature <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math> of the metal and time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> will be closest to :",
